msgid "self.mavproxy"
msgstr "self.mavproxy"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:253
#: f25900ca8f7641ec90fcdc5ce1a01dcf
msgid ""
"An pexpect object used to interact with the MAVProxy process.  All "
"MAVProxy commands are valid when sent to this object - e.g. ``set "
"shownoise 0``.  This is not always available - self.start_mavproxy() and "
"self.stop_mavproxy() should be used by a test if it requires MAVProxy."
msgstr ""
"一个用于与 MAVProxy 进程交互的 pexpect 对象。发送给该对象的所有 MAVProxy 命令均有效，例如 ``set "
"shownoise 0``。该对象并非始终可用——若测试需要 MAVProxy，应使用 self.start_mavproxy() 和 "
"self.stop_mavproxy()。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:255
#: 7bcc6c11a7134bc78aea4a77d01c8236
msgid "self.mav"
msgstr "self.mav"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:256
#: f64ae235afd64a4a9d124ec05e782e69
msgid ""
"A mavudp object connected to a the primary output port of the simulation "
"(usually TCP port 5760)."
msgstr "一个连接到仿真主输出端口（通常为 TCP 5760 端口）的 mavudp 对象。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:258
#: 8d195fa200f347d1870dbcd7f88f34b8
msgid "self.mav.mav"
msgstr "self.mav.mav"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:259
#: 7a37531a31b645c1b10c7d4d6005a4d5
msgid ""
"The mavudp's MAVLink object.  Can be used to send messages via MAVLink to"
" the SITL binary: ``self.mav.mav.system_time_send(time.time() * 1000000, "
"0)``"
msgstr ""
"mavudp 的 MAVLink 对象。可用于通过 MAVLink 向 SITL "
"二进制文件发送消息：``self.mav.mav.system_time_send(time.time() * 1000000, 0)``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:262
#: 80d6c677ed384c349bf21e1fd0e97db3
msgid "RC Overrides"
msgstr "RC 覆盖"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:264
#: 4a6faaca6d924cf6ba014e0a49414afe
msgid ""
"A test's call to ``self.set_rc(ch, value)`` effectively sets the RC "
"inputs for the simulated vehicle.  It is important to note that these are"
" not \"RC overrides\" - it is \"real\" simulated RC input.  The SITL "
"binary listens on a network port for packets of 8-bit or 16-bit "
"quantities representing the RC input.  MAVProxy is invoked in such a way "
"that data which it would otherwise have sent as MAVLink RC override "
"packets are delivered to that network socket instead."
msgstr ""
"测试中调用 ``self.set_rc(ch, value)`` 实际上设置了仿真飞行器的 RC 输入。需要注意的是，这不是「RC "
"覆盖」，而是「真实的」仿真 RC 输入。SITL 二进制文件监听一个网络端口上表示 RC 输入的 8 位或 16 位数据包。MAVProxy "
"被配置为将其原本作为 MAVLink RC 覆盖包发送的数据改为发送到该网络套接字。"

