#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:284
#: ead99f3a710346d9a100de09a140adc1
msgid "Conducting an automated git bisect with an autotest"
msgstr "使用自动化测试进行自动 git bisect"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:286
#: df76f68f632e47f3bb0bdefcf63fe564
msgid ""
"``Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py`` can be used as the script argument to"
" ``git bisect run``.  It can run an autotest test - by name - and tell "
"you which commit broke that test."
msgstr ""
"``Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py`` 可作为 ``git bisect run`` "
"的脚本参数使用。它可按名称运行自动化测试，并告诉您哪次提交导致了该测试失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:288
#: 517738ebda094bf3aa4e08f640d55f9b
msgid "To accomplish this:"
msgstr "具体步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:290
#: 57995563939c4df4973c4597045ce419
msgid "make sure you're not already running a bisect - ``git bisect reset``"
msgstr "确保您当前没有在进行 bisect—— ``git bisect reset``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:291
#: c02f1dad43a24cb6a87a9c38bbb25bff
msgid ""
"create a topic branch for your new test (based on master) which fails now"
" but you know would have passed at some stage in the past"
msgstr "基于 master 为新测试创建一个主题分支，该测试现在失败，但您知道在过去的某个时间点是可以通过的"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:292
#: 58933673564e4f9c8c3b3573dc239e56
msgid "write your test - which should fail on your topic branch, and commit it"
msgstr "编写您的测试——该测试应在您的主题分支上失败，然后提交"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:293
#: db3f564894a24cb8ab550a3e1aa8a3a9
msgid ""
"you can test your branch by creating a branch at some stage in the past "
"and cherry-picking your test into that branch.  This may not be trivial "
"depending on what changes have been made in the autotest framework"
msgstr ""
"您可以通过在过去的某个时间点创建一个分支，并将您的测试 cherry-pick "
"到该分支来测试您的分支。具体难易程度取决于自动化测试框架中发生的变更。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:294
#: c342cef98ed0417fb83b8e651ef8ff05
msgid "``cp Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py /tmp``  # always use modern helper"
msgstr "``cp Tools/autotest/bisect-helper.py /tmp``  # 始终使用最新的 helper"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:295
#: 312ae9773fa84aba82db12eaea4fbf1d
msgid "``git bisect reset``"
msgstr "``git bisect reset``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:296
#: 5d1bcfc1de47459d943a8b36adab457f
msgid "``git bisect start``"
msgstr "``git bisect start``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:297
#: 362717749d164c6c8a4e1fd3e61ded90
msgid "``git bisect bad``  - we know the test fails where it was written"
msgstr "``git bisect bad``  ——我们知道测试在编写时所处的提交处失败"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:298
#: 85eb616e0d4c4e12bf2974b157389764
msgid "``git bisect good HEAD~1024``  - this is where we know the test passes"
msgstr "``git bisect good HEAD~1024``  ——这是我们知道测试通过的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:299
#: f9e61a28e1a1406f9349dba58680b87f
msgid ""
"``time git bisect run /tmp/bisect-helper.py --autotest --autotest-"
"vehicle=Plane --autotest-test=NeedEKFToArm --autotest-branch=wip"
"/bisection-using-named-test``"
msgstr ""
"``time git bisect run /tmp/bisect-helper.py --autotest --autotest-"
"vehicle=Plane --autotest-test=NeedEKFToArm --autotest-branch=wip"
"/bisection-using-named-test``"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:301
#: 20198706577b468e95f99a395e7f7b48
msgid ""
"In the last command, you need to specify the vehicle, new test name, and "
"the name of the topic branch which contains your new test."
msgstr "在最后一条命令中，您需要指定飞行器类型、新测试名称，以及包含新测试的 topic 分支名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:303
#: 3ab4886c138e45a096bd01477b81810a
msgid ""
"After this has run you should know which commit broke the functionality "
"being tested.  And you also have a new test for the regression suite "
"which you should PR!"
msgstr "运行完成后，您应该能够确定是哪个 commit 破坏了被测功能。同时，您也得到了一个新的回归测试，请提交 PR！"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:307
#: 85e1f23e15a1471a80d0b9cf59b34ccd
msgid "Using with callgrind / kcachegrind"
msgstr "与 callgrind / kcachegrind 结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:309
#: 71cce2c7ab6749829861d88a8c90524e
msgid ""
"Valgrind is actually a collection of tools - mostly it is used with the "
"\"memcheck\" tool to find memory read/write problems."
msgstr "Valgrind 实际上是一套工具集——通常使用其 「memcheck」 工具来检测内存读写问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/the-ardupilot-autotest-framework.rst:311
#: a8432bc3a68f4df2a7c13416be43942b
msgid ""
"Valgrind's callgrind tool allows for performance analysis.  autotest.py "
"has built-in support for running ArduPilot under callgrind."
msgstr ""
"Valgrind 的 callgrind 工具可用于性能分析。autotest.py 内置了在 callgrind 下运行 ArduPilot "
"的支持。"

